+- **t6** (`upload::tests::test_overwrite_object` alone, 1536 lane, fixed tree): **ok** in 6.66 s, queue EXIT 0, peak
+  1089 MiB.
+- **ob** (the same test on the BASELINE negctl tree): **ok** in 6.55 s, peak 1061 MiB. Its need for more than 1024 MiB
